        "TileImage": "$($repository 36eab2c5-79b3-4aca-bf8b-8b40ff64c3d5).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning, 47.\rYour target is the Italian singer Cristina Dionisi.\rShe&apos;s been involved in numerous criticisms of the mayor of Sapienza.\rThe mayor himself didn&apos;t commission this job because he doesn&apos;t want anyone to contradict him. We know it sounds dictatorial, but he who pays the piper calls the tune.\rThe mayor specifically asked us to make it look like an accident so there can be no suspicion that he ordered it.\rGood hunting 47.",
